y, since the solutions become parallel to the straight-line solution containing the vector {{field-9}} as they move towards the origin, the eigenvalue that determines the long-term behavior (dominant eigenvalue) is \n{{field-10}}.\n\nTherefore,\n{{field-11}} \n$<0.$" 13194139534962 17592186045417 true] [17592186445872 1072 #uuid "0b89fafc-c196-5520-9710-898a3b3a16af" 13194139534962 17592186045417 true] [17592186445872 1074 "The straight-line solutions of the system have the form\n\n$$\n{c}_{1}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{1}t}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\,\\text{and}\\,{c}_{2}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{2}t}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ has the equation\n\n$$\ny=\\frac{1}{2}x,\n$$\n\nas shown below.\n\n![](images/ab/abdb72ad4cd1bbde4e53c901b6b285904078f456a3fa52ab667bf1675d2d68dd.png)\n\nThe tangents along this line are pointing $\\text{toward the origin},$ meaning that the solutions of the form \n${c}_{1}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{1}t}[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$\nmust approach $\\text{the origin}$ as $t\\to \\infty .$ So, we must have ${\\lambda }_{1}<0.$\n\nThe line that passes through the origin and is parallel to ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ has the equation\n\n$$\ny=-x,\n$$\n\nas shown below.\n\n![](images/cf/cf3cb4b5756e5f382cd798d371e3d3e797f5ba0a146cdb8424ed1c62c051564b.png)\n\nThe tangents along this line are pointing $\\text{toward the origin},$ meaning that the solutions of the form \n${c}_{2}{e}^{{\\lambda }_{2}t}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$\nmust approach $\\text{the origin}$ as $t\\to \\infty .$ So, we must have ${\\lambda }_{2}<0.$\n\nSo, for this particular system, both eigenvalues are negative. The eigenvalue that determines the long-term behavior (dominant eigenvalue) is the one closest to $0.$\n\nNow, since the solutions become parallel to the straight-line solution containing the vector ${v}_{1}$ as they move towards the origin, the eigenvalue that determines the long-term behavior is ${\\lambda }_{1}.$\n\nTherefore, ${\\lambda }_{2}<{\\lambda }_{1}<0.$" 13194139534962 17592186045417 true] [17592186445873 1058 #edb/ref 17592186445875 13194139534962 17592186045417 true] [17592186445873 1062 #uuid "890e1bbb-beae-5fdb-be53-89bb4d05b48c" 13194139534962 17592186045417 true] [17592186445873 1063 #edb/ref 17592186308440 13194139534962 17592186045417 true] [17592186445874 1058 #edb/ref 17592186445873 13194139534962 17592186045417 true] [17592186445874 1062 #uuid "8d1fddce-e4a2-52df-8528-72a5c48accd4" 13194139534962 17592186045417 true] [17592186445874 1063 #edb/ref 17592186308394 13194139534962 17592186045417 true] [17592186445875 1062 #uuid "fbfc2c04-e3d2-560f-8831-93c9e7b92836" 13194139534962 17592186045417 true] [17592186445875 1063 #edb/ref 17592186445872 13194139534962 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-d2b2d9b3-d32e-5f2d-a155-ebeabb741ec6" 17592186445831 "answer-1ae8b196-5ad9-5a3f-a6de-6fcd3c9f127c" 17592186445832 "answer-209d1659-07d9-5146-90a0-eca8c85994e3" 17592186445833 "answer-237f9de9-6c5d-5f20-b582-3eb3bbef4efa" 17592186445834 "answer-2520c485-dc99-54f0-b77e-c8ef590757a8" 17592186445835 "answer-2b304673-dff6-52bc-8311-4a1fff9ecbd5" 17592186445836 "answer-4738cecd-a1b1-5fe8-afbf-30fcc911282f" 17592186445837 "answer-53c726e6-a3ba-50b4-95e0-5792dd7f4c3d" 17592186445838 "answer-5c3bb420-a062-589d-8a15-df82a283ae00" 17592186445839 "answer-62bae53b-ff93-5d73-a244-bee46f728e63" 17592186445840 "answer-65d3a244-2894-5054-959a-79c09f894eda" 17592186445841 "answer-6a3e4a1c-c6ba-518c-a073-ef3580a687e8" 17592186445842 "answer-7a0bda8e-ed27-5d9e-bbe1-a1b8939dd25e" 17592186445843 "answer-7ab5509b-d4bc-5b4a-9228-5644b24e6700" 17592186445844 "answer-82469ff2-6605-5dc2-9350-2f036fef770f" 17592186445845 "answer-83514dc6-fda1-583f-9a2c-cfed43f1f88e" 17592186445846 "answer-86244ec8-b8e9-5ffa-a880-ffe1b9fb6f4a" 17592186445847 "answer-8f80a572-c0b6-59e5-